  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Animations in general have been extremely desynced on the beta and it has happened between normal toggles in my expressions parameter list on my avatar, as well as animations triggered by contacts that are not in that list. They work maybe 70 - 80% of the time, but they do quite frequently get desynced to where I may not see someone pull out the lightsaber when they are in my avatar that is in the radial menu or a shield that they can toggled on and off with a contact receiver out in front of their avatar. Sometimes the animations are opposite, so when they toggle the shield on with the contact for themselves, since it is already on for me, it will then be toggled off. \nI've come across more than 20 people in the beta mentioning similar issues with their avatars and I wanted to make a post about it to make sure the devs are aware of the issue.",
